      "importance": "common",
      "type": "penitential",
      "description": "A prayer expressing sorrow for sins committed and firm purpose of amendment, commonly recited during confession",
      "origin": "Traditional Catholic prayer developed for the sacrament of penance",
      "origin_date": "~1400",
      "usage": "Recited during the sacrament of confession, examination of conscience, and personal prayer",
